\par\par \uc2 Election 2024\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 The Buzz at GOP's Latest Donor Confab: Trump's Trial,  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  and \uc2 Marjorie Taylor Greene\uc2 ; Presumptive Republican nominee, looking to unify the party, tries to quell conservative revolt against House Speaker Mike Johnson\b0\par\par\uc2 By Vivian Salama \par \uc2 1,078 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 May 2024\par 12:30 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2024 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 PALM BEACH, Fla.\u8212\'20\'14As the who's who of the Republican Party descended upon this small barrier-island town that \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  calls home, it wasn't just the headliners receiving buzz. Contributors, lawmakers and party officials took note of the no-shows at this year's \uc2 Republican National Committee\uc2  spring donor retreat.\par \par \uc2 Not included this year were several party rabble-rousers, including Reps. \uc2 Marjorie Taylor Greene\uc2  (R., Ga.), \uc2 Matt Gaetz\uc2  (R., Fla.) and \uc2 Lauren Boebert\uc2  (R., Colo.). Greene this week {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/policy/marjorie-taylor-greene-to-force-vote-on-ousting-speaker-mike-johnson-next-week-acb6b3c4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plans to renew her effort }}}\uc2  to remove Republican Mike Johnson as House speaker.\par \par \uc2 One Republican lawmaker with knowledge of Trump's relationship with Greene said the former president is furious with her and believes she needs to rein in her attacks.\par \par \uc2 Several donors said that with six months left until Election Day, the party has no appetite for the heightened risk created by the infighting. These donors added that many party officials had soured on other far-right lawmakers including Gaetz and Boebert, whom they view as potentially disruptive to party cohesion.\par \par \uc2 Trump, who addressed the crowd at his Mar-a-Lago resort Saturday, spoke by phone with Greene this past week to express his disapproval for her efforts to oust Johnson, according to people familiar with the conversation. Trump told her that such a move risked destabilizing the party ahead of his rematch with President Biden this fall, these people said.\par \par \uc2 It wasn't immediately clear if the conversation was enough to convince Greene against bringing a seldom-used procedure called a "motion to vacate" against Johnson.\par \par \uc2 The Trump campaign and spokesmen for Greene and Johnson didn't respond to a request for comment. Trump has publicly voiced support for both Greene and Johnson, and has said that the speaker is doing a "very good job."\par \par \uc2 Party unity was a major theme over the weekend. Several speakers at the retreat, including Johnson and Rep. Byron Donalds (R., Fla.), pressed Republicans to come together. Both said intraparty warring could backfire come November if voters feel the GOP has lost control despite holding the House majority, according to people familiar with their closed-door remarks. Donors and political operatives said party infighting could have the biggest impact on down-ballot races if there is a perception that the party is unable to leverage its House majority.\par \par \uc2 Johnson, who spoke at the \uc2 RNC\uc2  retreat Friday, received widespread support from many attendees, who hailed his recent efforts to get a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/policy/senate-pushes-ukraine-israel-aid-closer-to-finish-line-290c07ab"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supplemental security package }}}\uc2  passed with bipartisan support, albeit heavily reliant on Democrats. His speech, according to attendees, focused largely on policy priorities, including \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , immigration and the economy.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  politics\u8212\'20\'14including Florida's recently enacted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/six-week-abortion-ban-florida-c5f00f7e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six-week \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  ban }}}\uc2 \u8212\'20\'14was a big talker at the event. Trump's decision to defer to state laws rather than campaigning on a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban was seen as a necessity by Republicans at this year's retreat, with one prominent GOP lawmaker describing it as the "least bad option."\par \par \uc2 Attendees were bused Saturday from the Four Seasons Palm Beach to Mar-a-Lago for a luncheon featuring a speech by Trump, his former GOP opponent \uc2 Vivek Ramaswamy\uc2  and GOP Reps. Wesley Hunt (R., Texas) and Donalds.\par \par \uc2 Trump popped down to Florida this weekend after a critical day of testimony Friday in the New York criminal trial in which he is charged with falsifying records related to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/hope-hicks-on-trump-campaign-messaging-we-were-all-just-following-his-lead-f1fbd2d0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hush-money payment }}}\uc2  to the adult-film actress Stormy Daniels. Several attendees at the GOP retreat said the New York trial and the other charges against him in other jurisdictions were "worrisome," but many found solace in several polls, particularly in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/trump-biden-poll-swing-states-ad594acb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 critical swing states }}}\uc2 , showing Trump at an advantage.\par \par \uc2 The charges were on Trump's mind as he vented on his social-media site about the trial minutes before playing host to GOP delegates at his home Saturday, calling it a "witch hunt that would NEVER be let in by a fair Judge."\par \par \uc2 Trump delivered lengthy remarks to donors that largely mirrored his speeches at rallies, according to several people in attendance. According to one attendee, Trump broached the subject of his New York trial with humor and talked about how he handles the pressure and stress while not letting it get to him. He also gave Johnson a "glowing endorsement," this attendee said.\par \par \uc2 During his speech, Trump invited a number of people to join him on stage.\par \par \uc2 While Trump faces a better-financed Biden this fall, donors over the weekend dismissed the GOP's financial disadvantage, calling it customary for an incumbent. Several said that fundraising and spending don't guarantee victory, as in 2016, when Hillary Clinton outspent Trump, only to fall short on Election Day.\par \par \uc2 Campaign officials told donors they raised just over $76 million in April, according to officials who attended the event.\par \par \uc2 Speakers at the event included Sens. \uc2 Marco Rubio\uc2  (R., Fla.), Tim Scott (R., S.C.), J.D. Vance (R., Ohio), Reps. \uc2 Elise Stefanik\uc2  (R., N.Y.) and Mike Waltz (R., Fla.), and Govs. \uc2 Doug Burgum\uc2  (R., N.D.) and \uc2 Kristi Noem\uc2  (R., S.D.).\par \par \uc2 The swirling controversy over Noem's dog, Cricket\u8212\'20\'14whom she shot dead after it attacked a neighbor's chickens, the governor writes in her coming memoir\u8212\'20\'14wasn't a major concern to most attendees. Some said they grew up in rural or farming areas and understood the context, although most joked that they might now have left that detail out of their own memoirs.\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 Whom do you think \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is likely to pick as his running mate? Join the conversation below.\par \par \uc2 Attendees conceded that no one stood out among those considered as a potential running mate, with one person joking that it was like "tap dancing for your parents," saying they were performing to a friendly crowd who would support any of them in the role.\par \par \uc2 Former Democratic Illinois Gov. \uc2 Rod Blagojevich\uc2 , whose 14-year prison sentence was commuted by Trump in 2020, was also in attendance. He described the criminal charges against Trump as a "witch hunt just like what they did to me," referring to his own conviction for trying to sell \uc2 Barack Obama\uc2 's vacated Senate seat\u8212\'20\'14an accusation he continues to deny.\par \par \uc2 Write to Vivian Salama at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:vivian.salama@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 vivian.salama@wsj.com }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020240505ek55000jh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
