\par\par \uc2 Health News\par \uc2 Health\par \b \uc2 More Women Choose  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Pills as States Crack Down; Access to medication  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  has grown with policy changes including expansion of telehealth services\b0\par\par\uc2 By Jennifer Calfas \par \uc2 659 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 March 2024\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2024 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fall of Roe v. Wade  }}}\uc2  nearly two years ago {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/fall-of-roe-v-wade-upends-abortion-landscape-for-american-women-11656081225"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fundamentally changed  }}}\uc2  when, how and where women get abortions. Medication abortions have become more common despite the elimination of federal protections for the procedure, new data show.\par \par \uc2 Medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose to account for nearly two-thirds of abortions in the U.S. in 2023, according to a report released Tuesday by the \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2 , a research group that supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. In 2020, medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a two-drug regimen approved to terminate pregnancies up to 10 weeks of gestation, accounted for 53% of U.S. procedures.\par \par \uc2 Guttmacher\uc2 's report showed that the number and rate of abortions performed in the U.S. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/roe-v-wade-is-gone-but-abortions-are-on-the-rise-383ffaf4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climbed in 2023  }}}\uc2  even with near-total bans on the procedure in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/abortion-state-guide-laws-bf5072da"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than a dozen states  }}}\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics have added staff, hours and locations in states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is legal. Advocacy groups have increased funding for traveling patients.\par \par \uc2 Guttmacher found more than 642,000 medication abortions in 2023 were performed through formal healthcare providers. The number of medication abortions is likely higher because the estimate doesn't include self-managed abortions, when women seek \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills through community groups or abroad, according to Guttmacher.\par \par \uc2 Access to medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  has grown with policy changes including the expansion of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/supreme-court-abortion-pill-ruling-access-9a5597e3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 telehealth \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  services  }}}\uc2 . The Food and Drug Administration in 2021 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/fda-allows-women-to-get-abortion-pill-by-mail-11639698022?"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relaxed restrictions on mifepristone  }}}\uc2 , one of two drugs used in medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , allowing it to be delivered by mail-order pharmacies.\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court this month plans {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/law/supreme-court-arguments-abortion-pill-mifepristone-c31de31a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to hear oral arguments  }}}\uc2  in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/health/supreme-court-to-decide-abortion-pill-mifepristone-regulation-challenge-4db2f6b2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 challenge to those and other relaxed restrictions  }}}\uc2 . While the court battle is playing out, bricks-and-mortar pharmacies can seek certification to dispense the pill; CVS and \uc2 Walgreens\uc2 . While the court battle is playing out, bricks-and-mortar pharmacies can seek certification to dispense the pill; CVS and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/health/healthcare/cvs-walgreens-to-sell-abortion-pill-mifepristone-within-weeks-8d36f801"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said earlier this month  }}}\uc2  that their pharmacies would do so.\par \par \uc2 The number of abortions in the U.S. increased to about one million in 2023, according to Guttmacher. The rate was higher last year than any year since 2012 and the number was the highest since 2011, the group said.\par \par \uc2 The findings reflect how \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers and funders {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/roe-v-wade-is-gone-but-abortions-are-on-the-rise-383ffaf4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have adapted to shifting laws  }}}\uc2  by increasing access in states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains legal and paying for women from out of state to get there.\par \par \uc2 "If people need healthcare," said Amy Friedrich-Karnik, Guttmacher's director of federal policy, "they will find ways to get the healthcare they need."\par \par \uc2 Women from other states make up more than half of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/new-mexico-abortion-clinics-demand-1a888fa7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 patients in Kansas and New Mexico  }}}\uc2  and more than one-third in Illinois and North Carolina, according to Guttmacher.\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 What impact will the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill have on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a political issue? Join the conversation below.\par \par \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  of the Rocky Mountains, which operates in New Mexico, Colorado, southern Nevada and Wyoming, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-providers-in-illinois-colorado-and-florida-prepare-for-patient-influx-if-roe-is-overturned-11655560800"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added staff, hours and a larger center  }}}\uc2 . The regional organization has diverted funding from breast cancer screenings as well as birth control and educational programs to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "I'm proud that we're in the place that we're in that we can provide this care for patients traveling from states that have banned their healthcare, but it also puts such a strain on our ability to do all of our work," said Adrienne Mansanares, president and chief executive of \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  of the Rocky Mountains.\par \par \uc2 States bordering ones with \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans and restrictions are receiving more out-of-state patients. Some women fly or drive many hours to reach clinics.\par \par \uc2 More abortions in these states aren't only because of out-of-state patients, according to Guttmacher. More telehealth services, new protections for the procedure and financial aid have also contributed to higher \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  numbers, the group said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Jennifer Calfas at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:jennifer.calfas@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jennifer.calfas@wsj.com  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020240319ek3j0012y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
