\par \par \uc2 Mifepristone is part of a two-drug regimen that is used to end pregnancies up to 10 weeks of gestation. PHOTO: Michael Noble Jr. for The Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 Pharmacy chains CVS and \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  will begin dispensing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/law/abortion-pill-access-case-texas-judge-11651775689"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mifepristone  }}}\uc2 , commonly known as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/health/abortion-pill-increase-roe-wade-68472ff8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  pill  }}}\uc2 , in coming weeks.\par \par \uc2 The two chains said Friday they received certification to dispense the pills, following {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/health/pharma/over-the-counter-birth-control-pill-to-be-available-within-weeks-on-retail-shelves-8037c880"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a regulatory shift  }}}\uc2  last year to allow bricks-and-mortar pharmacies to offer {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-faces-fresh-deadline-in-abortion-pill-case-6d7b9049"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the pill with a prescription  }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The companies said they would distribute the pill in a way {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/new-mexico-abortion-clinics-demand-1a888fa7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 consistent with state laws  }}}\uc2 \u8212\'20\'14meaning it won't be offered in states that don't allow {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/abortion-state-guide-laws-bf5072da"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 legal access to \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  through 10 weeks\u8212\'20\'14and will begin rolling out the pill in a handful of states. Both said they wouldn't make mifepristone available via mail order. The drug is already available via other mail-order pharmacies and telehealth platforms.\par \par \uc2 A CVS spokeswoman said its stores in Massachusetts and Rhode Island would begin filling prescriptions for mifepristone by the end of March. In states where it is allowed, all CVS pharmacies are expected to offer it within the next 45 days or so, she said.\par \par \uc2 A spokesman for \uc2 Walgreens Boots Alliance\uc2  said it expected to begin dispensing the pills within a week in some locations. The company will start with five states: New York, Pennsylvania, Massachusetts, California, and Illinois. The spokesman said mifepristone eventually would be available in all locations in states where it is allowed, but he didn't put a time frame on when the rollout would be complete.\par \par \uc2 "Our goal is to gradually expand availability to all locations in all legally permissible states in a phased approach," he said.\par \par \uc2 The New York Times\uc2  earlier reported the pharmacies' certification.\par \par \uc2 "Today is an important milestone in ensuring access to mifepristone, a drug that has been approved by the \uc2 Food and Drug Administration\uc2  as safe and effective for more than 20 years," said President Biden, who has made \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights central to his re-election campaign.\par \par \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  last year became the first pharmacy chain to say {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/walgreens-will-sell-the-abortion-pill-pharmacy-says-11672870977"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 it would pursue certification  }}}\uc2  to dispense the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill, followed soon after by CVS. \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  clarified that it wouldn't dispense the pill {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/walgreens-wont-sell-abortion-pill-in-some-states-9d9e2131"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 where it would be illegal  }}}\uc2  after Republican state attorneys general warned in letters that pharmacies could face legal consequences.\par \par \uc2 Mifepristone is part of a two-drug regimen that is used to end pregnancies up to 10 weeks of gestation. It is used in more than half of all abortions, the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights nonprofit \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2  has said. CVS will carry generic mifepristone, made by drugmaker GenBioPro, and \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  will carry brand-name Mifeprex from drugmaker Danco.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FDA\uc2  during the Covid-19 pandemic allowed mifepristone to be sent via mail-order pharmacies. \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights activists have pushed for the pill to be available also through physical pharmacies. After the regulatory shift last year, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pills-to-be-available-more-widely-under-new-fda-rules-11672789765"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pharmacies had to seek certification  }}}\uc2  from drugmakers to be able to dispense the pill in bricks-and-mortar locations.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill remains at the center of litigation {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/law/supreme-court-arguments-abortion-pill-mifepristone-c31de31a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 due to be argued  }}}\uc2  later this month in the Supreme Court. The court is set to consider whether the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/health/supreme-court-to-decide-abortion-pill-mifepristone-regulation-challenge-4db2f6b2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FDA properly loosened restrictions  }}}\uc2  around the pill. The court could decide to reinstate the pill's original safeguards, which would then mean the pharmacies would have to stop dispensing.\par \par \uc2 "Today's announcement from CVS and \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  shows what we have always known: medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  can and should be treated as any other \uc2 FDA\uc2  -approved medication," said Kirsten Moore, founder of the nonprofit Expanding Medication \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Access Project.\par \par \uc2 Antiabortion groups have said that mifepristone is dangerous to women and can cause heavy bleeding and pain. They have also said that shipping the pills is illegal under {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/a-19th-century-law-could-help-influence-the-abortion-pills-future-639dddb6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an 1873 law  }}}\uc2 , called the Comstock Act, which made it unlawful to send "obscene" or "immoral" materials via mail.\par \par \uc2 "The decision by CVS and \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  to sell dangerous \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  drugs is shameful, and the harm to unborn babies and their mothers incalculable," said Katie Daniel, state policy director for antiabortion group Susan B. Anthony Pro-Life America.\par \par \uc2 "This reckless policy was made possible by the Biden administration, which is pushing to turn every pharmacy and post office in America into an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  center for the sake of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  industry greed," she said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Liz Essley Whyte at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:liz.whyte@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 liz.whyte@wsj.com  }}}\uc2  and Anna Wilde Mathews at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Anna.Mathews@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Anna.Mathews@wsj.com  }}}\uc2  and Anna Wilde Mathews at \par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020240301ek31004ph\par }{\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
