\par\par \uc2 Election 2024\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  Says She Is Ready to Serve as Biden Faces Age Scrutiny; In a recent interview, the vice president cites her 'capacity to lead' after stops on her  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2 -rights tour\b0\par\par\uc2 By Tarini Parti \par \uc2 1,974 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 February 2024\par 14:38 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2024 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Vice President \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  was detailing her priorities for the campaign during a flight on Air Force Two early last week when she was asked a delicate question hanging over the Democratic ticket: Do {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/biden-has-more-than-an-age-problem-voters-dont-see-him-as-presidential-f5212415"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 voters' concerns  }}}\uc2  about President Biden's age mean she must convince them she is ready to serve?\par \par \uc2 "I am ready to serve. There's no question about that," Harris responded bluntly. Everyone who sees her on the job, Harris said, "walks away fully aware of my capacity to lead."\par \par \uc2 The response during an interview with The Wall Street Journal on Tuesday came two days before a special counsel report on Biden's handling of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/democrats-anxiety-over-bidens-age-grows-after-special-counsel-report-faf6578c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 classified documents amplified concerns  }}}\uc2  about the 81-year-old incumbent's mental acuity. The report said Biden displayed "diminished faculties" in interviews and called him an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/national-security/joe-biden-classified-document-case-revelations-3db06ca6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 "elderly man with a poor memory."  }}}\uc2  about the 81-year-old incumbent's mental acuity. The report said Biden displayed "diminished faculties" in interviews and called him an\par \par \uc2 The findings have intensified the scrutiny on Harris, 59, the first woman and Black vice president, whose tenure has been marked by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/kamala-harris-prepares-to-hit-the-road-for-biden-despite-cracks-in-her-support-45a4015d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 criticism of her political skills  }}}\uc2 . What had been quiet talk of whether Harris could step into the presidency is now spilling into the open.\par \par \uc2 "There was always going to be a lot of scrutiny and pressure on her in the 2024 campaign, and that moment's here now," said Jennifer Palmieri, who worked in the Obama and Clinton administrations and for \uc2 Hillary Clinton\uc2 's 2016 campaign. "I think that the special counsel's report has sort of accelerated that moment."\par \par \uc2 In recent months, Harris has taken on greater and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-is-kamala-harris-3ba86408"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more public responsibilities  }}}\uc2 . She has become the administration's lead {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/bidens-first-2024-campaign-rally-to-promote-abortion-rights-c89e1fa7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 messenger on \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights  }}}\uc2 , was put in charge of the White House's new Office of Gun Violence Prevention and is playing a higher-profile role in the administration's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/kamala-harris-works-to-bridge-democratic-divide-over-israel-gaza-war-49c016b6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 handling of the war in Gaza  }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Harris, who has joined Biden on calls with Israeli Prime Minister \uc2 Benjamin Netanyahu\uc2  and gave a forceful speech in Dubai on the conflict, has pushed the administration to articulate {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/world/middle-east/gaza-is-falling-into-absolute-chaos-aid-groups-say-5d37e9bf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more empathy for Palestinians  }}}\uc2  and to focus on a postconflict Gaza plan.\par \par \uc2 Shortly after the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/national-security/joe-biden-classified-documents-case-special-counsel-81df1bac"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 special counsel report was released  }}}\uc2 , Harris's team was asked by West Wing aides to have her appear on a Sunday news show to defend the president, according to a person familiar with the request. Harris didn't want to wait. At an event on Friday, Harris {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/video/kamala-harris-calls-biden-special-counsel-report-politically-motivated/44E9E847-C770-436B-BF4B-E9F4C5B5DB95"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 publicly slammed the report  }}}\uc2  as politically motivated and gratuitous, defending the president strongly as being "on top of and in front of it all."\par \par \uc2 There is no serious talk of replacing Biden on this year's presidential ticket, Democratic officials say, pointing to the filing deadlines for primary ballot access that have already closed. In the unlikely circumstance that Biden withdraws as the Democratic nominee, Harris would still have to earn the required delegates to take his place at the party's convention in August. If it were to happen after the convention, a special meeting of the \uc2 Democratic National Committee\uc2  would decide the party's presidential ticket, according to the DNC's rules. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
