\par \par \uc2 Medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  accounted for 54% of abortions in the U.S. in 2020. PHOTO: Taylor Glascock for The Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 Do you need a prescription? Where can I get an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill?\par \par \uc2 In the U.S., \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills require a prescription from a healthcare provider. The \uc2 FDA\uc2  had previously required patients to pick up mifepristone in person from a clinical setting. The agency lifted that restriction in April 2021 and allowed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills to be sent by mail. In January 2023, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pills-to-be-available-more-widely-under-new-fda-rules-11672789765"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FDA passed a measure  }}}\uc2  allowing bricks-and-mortar pharmacies to also dispense mifepristone.\par \par \uc2 The Fifth Circuit's order sought to temporarily reinstate some earlier restrictions, including requiring in-person doctor visits to obtain the drug. The Supreme Court has lifted those restrictions for now.\par \par \uc2 Patients can buy mifepristone and misoprostol without a prescription from online pharmacies based overseas. International health providers, including Aid Access, connect U.S. patients to physicians in Europe and mail them \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills from outside the country. The \uc2 FDA\uc2  has said that the online sale of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills that aren't regulated by the agency is a violation of U.S. law.\par \par \uc2 "Healthcare providers based internationally may feel more insulated" from potential legal ramifications in the U.S., said Julia Kaye, a lawyer with the American Civil Liberties Union Reproductive Freedom Project.\par \par \uc2 The safety of these imported medications is also not guaranteed. Plan C, an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -pill advocacy group, has a pill-finding guide on its website, organized by state. For each provider listed, Plan C highlights any potential legal or safety risks.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14Sarah Toy and Laura Kusisto contributed to this article.\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020231213ejcd007ep\par }{\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
