\par \par \uc2 Democrats are portraying themselves as a crucial block on potential \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions or a total ban in Virginia, a state led by Republican Gov. Glenn Youngkin. PHOTO: Valerie Plesch for The Wall Street Journal\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://host2.adimpact.com/admo/viewer/2d72b524-0f1d-4c24-84a1-b4acc494038e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 In one of Beshear's campaign ads}}}\uc2 , an Owensboro, Ky., woman says she was raped by her stepfather at age 12. "Anyone who believes there should be no exceptions for rape and incest could never understand what it's like to stand in my shoes," she says. "I'm speaking out because women and girls need to have options. Daniel Cameron would give us none."\par \par \uc2 For 2024, President Biden's re-election campaign is already highlighting Democrats' commitment to protecting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. One of his first campaign ads included audio of former President Trump saying, "I'm the one that got rid of Roe v. Wade" and advocating punishment for women who get abortions.\par \par \uc2 Trump, who has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/how-ron-desantis-lost-florida-to-donald-trump-0200d5ae"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a commanding lead}}}\uc2  over other GOP primary candidates, has recently advised Republicans not to take a hard line against \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  because that makes it difficult to win elections. He called Florida Gov. \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 's decision to sign a six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban this April "a terrible thing."\par \par \uc2 Voters have grown more supportive of legalized abortions {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/support-for-legalized-abortion-grows-since-dobbs-ruling-wsj-poll-shows-11662210020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 since the Dobbs decision}}}\uc2 , polls by The Wall Street Journal and others have found. Some surveys also show that Americans are open to restricting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after 15 weeks of pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 What role do you think the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  issue will play in the 2024 election? Join the conversation below.\par \par \uc2 The Ohio constitutional amendment would protect the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  up to the point that a fetus can live outside the womb, generally at about 23 weeks of pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 Republican supermajorities in the general assembly passed a six-week ban in 2019, GOP Gov. \uc2 Mike DeWine\uc2  quickly signed it into law, and it briefly went into effect when the Supreme Court issued its Dobbs decision last summer.\par \par \uc2 The law has been blocked in court for most of the last year, but the Ohio Supreme Court this fall heard arguments about whether to allow the ban to go into effect. A decision is expected in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 As in other states with ballot contests, the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights side has outspent antiabortion groups in Ohio. The gulf became especially pronounced between Sept. 9 and Oct. 18, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights coalition spent $26.2 million to the antiabortion coalition's $9.1 million, campaign finance reports show.\par \par \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  and other \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights groups have said they have seen a fundraising boom, especially from small donors, in the aftermath of the Dobbs decision.\par \par \uc2 Susan B. Anthony\uc2  and other antiabortion groups depend more heavily on large givers, including the Catholic Church and \uc2 Richard Uihlein\uc2 , a billionaire conservative who founded an Illinois-based industrial shipping company. Uihlein has put $4 million into the Ohio fight alone, state campaign finance reports show.\par \par \uc2 Most of the national groups on both sides of the issue are nonprofits that report top-line fundraising information only years later and often don't disclose donors at all. Nonetheless, it has become clear that the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights advocates are better-funded.\par \par \uc2 In Michigan, the lead group supporting last year's ballot-initiative to protect \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the state constitution spent about $43 million while the coalition opposing it spent about $21 million, according to state campaign finance reports.\par \par \uc2 The constitutional amendment there succeeded by a 13-percentage-point margin. The issue helped animate Democratic voters, who re-elected Gov. \uc2 Gretchen Whitmer\uc2  and elected enough Democratic legislators to give the party a majority in both chambers for the first time in four decades.\par \par \uc2 Susan B. Anthony\uc2  and its allies said they spent about $78 million during last year's midterm elections, about half of the estimated $150 million Planned Parenthood and other pro-choice groups spent.\par \par \uc2 "We have to do better and we will," Dannenfelser said of raising and spending money.\par \par \uc2 Ellen Barrosse, a donor to \uc2 Susan B. Anthony\uc2  and former Republican National Committeewoman from Delaware, said her relief after the Dobbs decision was quickly replaced by fear when Kansas voters rejected an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. She said she doesn't think other donors realize yet how much the antiabortion movement stands to lose.\par \par \uc2 "I feel very strongly that we're heading toward a moment when people who care about this issue are going to wake up and say, 'oh my gosh, what happened?'" she said. "Donors have to wake up now instead of waiting until next November."\par \par \uc2 Write to Julie Bykowicz at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:julie.bykowicz@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 julie.bykowicz@wsj.com}}}\uc2  and Laura Kusisto at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020231106ejb6001e1\par }{\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
