\par \par \uc2 Funds and nonprofits that help finance abortions have raised millions of dollars to help women pay for procedures and travel. PHOTO: Angela Owens/The Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 Efforts focused on helping women travel seem to have also made it easier for some in-state residents to obtain abortions. For example, providing more telehealth appointments to accommodate increased demand can also make appointments more accessible for women in rural areas.\par \par \uc2 In California, Planned Parenthood of Orange & San Bernardino Counties doubled the number of open appointments available for medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at its nine locations in spring 2022 in anticipation of the high court's decision, said Krista Hollinger, the Planned Parenthood branch's chief operating officer.\par \par \uc2 Those centers have seen an increase in out-of-state patients, but more Californians are getting abortions as well. Planned Parenthood of Orange & San Bernardino Counties saw a 20% increase in its total \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  patient volume since June 2022, while only about a fifth of that increase came from out-of-state patients.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers say that while the number of abortions may not have significantly declined, laws have nonetheless {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/doctors-struggle-with-state-abortion-restrictions-at-odds-with-federal-law-11657445400"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 created obstacles }}}\uc2 . For instance, women forced to travel out-of-state for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have to take time off work and involve friends and family members in a private medical decision because they need help traveling or with child care. Bans are also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/women-encounter-abortion-delays-as-clinics-draw-patients-from-out-of-state-f40e318b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pushing some abortions further back into pregnancy }}}\uc2 , when they become more complicated and expensive.\par \par \uc2 For antiabortion advocates, the policy options available to combat the ease of traveling and obtaining pills online present major challenges. Any efforts to prevent women from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/idaho-legislature-votes-to-restrict-abortion-travel-by-minors-c8911e43"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 traveling out of state }}}\uc2  for abortions could run up against constitutional challenges. Restricting the use of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills ordered online from overseas or out-of-state actors is difficult without punishing the women who take them\u8212\'20\'14long something antiabortion groups have pledged to avoid.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents are fighting hard to garner support from Republican presidential candidates for a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  limit, but such a proposal has little hope of making it through the current Congress.\par \par \uc2 "We're now forced to think about this as a national problem," said Katie Daniel, state policy director for Susan B. Anthony Pro-Life America, an antiabortion group.\par \par \uc2 Daniel said the antiabortion movement could end up back in federal court challenging shield laws enacted in a number of blue states designed to provide legal protection for doctors who prescribe pills to women in states with bans.\par \par \uc2 While few states appear likely to pass new \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans in the coming months, the landscape of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access remains unsettled. In Florida, which has seen one of the largest upticks in abortions since the Dobbs decision, the state's highest court is expected to release a decision soon that could allow a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/gov-ron-desantis-signs-florida-six-week-abortion-ban-b18029cc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six-week ban }}}\uc2  to go into effect. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
FF
