\par\par \uc2 Election 2024\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Trump Takes Heat From Religious Conservatives for Softness on  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Bans; Blowback comes as former president, who hasn't staked out a clear  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  position, heads to Iowa for campaign swing\b0\par\par\uc2 By John McCormick and Alex Leary \par \uc2 843 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 September 2023\par 13:00 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 's criticism of a six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban is triggering condemnation from some religious leaders and a few of his 2024 Republican presidential nomination rivals.\par \par \uc2 Trump is in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/trump-is-top-choice-for-nearly-60-of-gop-voters-wsj-poll-shows-877252b6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dominant position }}}\uc2  in the GOP contest and has often been able to brush off criticism from his right, but some opposed to seeing him become the nominee are seizing on recent remarks to question his commitment to an issue central to many {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/gop-presidential-hopefuls-aim-to-gain-on-trump-by-wooing-evangelicals-2ea3187d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Christian conservative voters }}}\uc2 . The former president and others in the party are grappling with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/senate-republicans-seek-winning-path-on-abortion-restrictions-175d3eab"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 how to discuss }}}\uc2  a topic that has cost Republicans support in recent elections.\par \par \uc2 In an interview broadcast Sunday on NBC's "Meet the Press," the former president said Florida Gov. \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2  had done a "terrible thing and a terrible mistake" by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/gov-ron-desantis-signs-florida-six-week-abortion-ban-b18029cc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 signing into law }}}\uc2  in April a ban on abortions after six weeks of pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 That law is nearly identical to one signed in July by Iowa Republican Gov. \uc2 Kim Reynolds\uc2 , who is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/gop-presidential-field-courts-governor-who-helped-iowa-turn-red-29316246"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 popular among conservatives }}}\uc2  in the state that will host the first nominating contest on Jan. 15. "It's never a 'terrible thing' to protect innocent life," she said online Tuesday in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KimReynoldsIA/status/1704251561717743673"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 critique }}}\uc2  directed at Trump.\par \par \uc2 Michael Demastus, a Des Moines pastor who has met with several of the GOP presidential candidates, said he thinks Trump's remarks will hurt his standing in the Iowa caucuses.\par \par \uc2 "It feels like there is no defense on this," he said, adding that he has talked to other pastors this week who are "really intensely bothered" by Trump's recent \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  comments.\par \par \uc2 "I don't understand his game," said Demastus, who called a six-week ban "not strict enough."\par \par \uc2 Others were more skeptical. "It's only going to hurt Trump at the margins," said Craig Robinson, a former Republican Party political director in Iowa.\par \par \uc2 The blowback comes as Trump prepares to make two stops Wednesday in Iowa, where he has spent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/trump-overshadows-desantis-and-gop-field-at-iowa-state-fair-84ab0243"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relatively little time }}}\uc2  so far this year compared with most of the roughly dozen candidates challenging him for the nomination.\par \par \uc2 Trump had previously criticized the Florida law but not as sharply. DeSantis, who is in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/trump-is-top-choice-for-nearly-60-of-gop-voters-wsj-poll-shows-877252b6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 distant second }}}\uc2  in the race, tried to capitalize and issued statements Tuesday from seven pastors and other conservatives in Iowa criticizing Trump's remarks.\par \par \uc2 "I don't know how you can even make the claim that you're somehow pro-life if you're criticizing states for enacting pro-life protections for babies that have heartbeats," DeSantis {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.radioiowa.com/2023/09/18/desantis-says-trumps-abortion-remarks-show-the-danger-in-reelecting-him/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said Monday }}}\uc2  on the Radio Iowa network. "He's changing in a way that is not consistent with the values of the people in Iowa."\par \par \uc2 In the NBC interview, Trump also refused to say at what point in a pregnancy he would support a federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, criticized Republicans who take too hard a stance, and suggested both parties can work together to put the issue behind them. DeSantis also has declined to say whether he would support a national ban.\par \par \uc2 The former president has long given mixed signals on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He blamed the issue for GOP losses in the 2022 midterm elections, though his critics point to poor performances by Trump-backed candidates in high-profile races. At the same time, Trump has taken credit for the landmark Supreme Court decision {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eliminating a constitutional right to \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , highlighting the justices he appointed.\par \par \uc2 In an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/posts/111093650151783099"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 online posting }}}\uc2  Tuesday, Trump again didn't clarify whether he thinks there should be a federal ban and if so, at what stage of the pregnancy. "In order to win in 2024, Republicans must learn how to talk about \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he wrote. "This issue cost us unnecessarily, but dearly, in the Midterms."\par \par \uc2 The dust-up prompted Sen. Tim Scott of South Carolina, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/elections/tim-scott-trump-desantis-iowa-gop-2024-f5e9ab4b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 who has been running third }}}\uc2  in Iowa polling, to take a rare swing at Trump while campaigning in the state on Monday. "President Trump said he would negotiate with the Democrats and walk back away from what I believe where we need to be, which is a 15-week limit on the federal level," he said.\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 How will Trump's views on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  play out in the 2024 election? Join the conversation below.\par \par \uc2 Bob Vander Plaats, who leads an Iowa-based conservative advocacy group and is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/a-top-man-of-god-in-iowa-wants-someone-other-than-trump-1280461b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 contemplating an endorsement }}}\uc2  of someone other than Trump, said Monday during {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/bobvanderplaats/status/1703924429070151828"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a conservative talk show appearance }}}\uc2  that the former president is "showing his true colors on the life issue."\par \par \uc2 An {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.desmoinesregister.com/story/news/politics/iowa-poll/caucus/2023/08/23/iowa-poll-how-likely-gop-caucusgoers-feel-about-7-issues-trump-abortion-ukraine-social-security/70624274007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Iowa poll }}}\uc2  released in August by the Des Moines Register, NBC News and \uc2 Mediacom\uc2  showed 54% of likely Republican caucus-goers, including three-quarters of evangelicals, say they would be more likely to favor a candidate who supports banning \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  nationwide after 15 weeks of pregnancy, with some exceptions.\par \par \uc2 Write to John McCormick at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:mccormick.john@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mccormick.john@wsj.com }}}\uc2  and Alex Leary at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:alex.leary@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 alex.leary@wsj.com }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230920ej9k003h4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
