\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Wisconsin  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Clinics Prepare to Resume Appointments; Litigation continues over an 1849 state law at the center of debate after Roe was overturned\b0\par\par\uc2 By Jennifer Calfas \par \uc2 1,224 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 September 2023\par 12:30 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Wisconsin has been in legal limbo for more than a year.\par \par \uc2 Planned Parenthood of Wisconsin halted \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services after the Supreme Court {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2  in June 2022, citing confusion over whether a more than 170-year-old state law banning most abortions could be enforced. The possibility that providers could be prosecuted was too high, \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  said, so the group stopped providing abortions in the Midwestern state.\par \par \uc2 That will change Monday, when Planned Parenthood of Wisconsin resumes \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services at two clinics in Milwaukee and Madison. The organization is leaning on a July ruling from a Dane County Circuit Court judge who said the 1849 act doesn't apply to consensual abortions. The clinics operate in counties where district attorneys have said they wouldn't enforce the law.\par \par \uc2 The potential risk of prosecution has declined, said Michelle Velasquez, director of legal advocacy and services at Planned Parenthood of Wisconsin. "In our view, we have absolute legal ability to provide \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services," Velasquez said.\par \par \uc2 "This is a really important first step, but it is just that\u8212\'20\'14a first step," she added. "We have a long road ahead of us."\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty in Wisconsin reflects the complex and still-shifting {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-dobbs-year-after-roe-support-politics-d1ef5a5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  landscape }}}\uc2  since the Supreme Court's June 2022 decision sent the issue back to the states. More than a dozen states {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/us-news/abortion-state-guide-laws-bf5072da"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 currently enforce bans }}}\uc2  on nearly all abortions. Other states have passed laws or amended their constitutions to protect the right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Wisconsin Gov. \uc2 Tony Evers\uc2 , a Democrat, has attempted several times to convene the state's Republican-led Legislature to repeal the 1849 law. The Legislature has declined to consider a repeal. Evers said Thursday that even with abortions resuming in the state, Wisconsinites must continue to further protect those rights.\par \par \uc2 State Attorney General \uc2 Josh Kaul\uc2 , a Democrat, last year sued district attorneys in three counties where Planned Parenthood of Wisconsin clinics operate to block enforcement of the previously dormant law. A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/wisconsin-supreme-court-election-shows-abortion-continues-to-sway-voters-4e47297c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 newly liberal-leaning Wisconsin Supreme Court }}}\uc2  has shifted expectations of how the lawsuit might play out.\par \par \uc2 Wisconsin House Speaker \uc2 Robin Vos\uc2 , a Republican, on Thursday said \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2 's decision to resume abortions was presumptive given ongoing litigation. He said he expects that outside private groups might challenge the decision.\par \par \uc2 "If \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  is so convinced that they are going to win at the state Supreme Court that they are willing to break the law, which the law on the books still is the 1849 statute, it's just another reminder that some people flub the law whether it's the law on the books or not," Vos said.\par \par \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2 's clinics in Madison and Milwaukee are now scheduling appointments and anticipating an unknown level of demand. For the past year residents capable of traveling outside the state for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  have gone to clinics in neighboring Illinois and Minnesota.\par \par \uc2 The Wisconsin clinics will operate within the same state legal framework they followed before the Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization ruling eliminated the constitutional right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Patients scheduled to visit the clinics Monday will be completing the counseling appointment required 24 hours before an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said Dr. Allison Linton, an obstetrician-gynecologist and associate medical director for Planned Parenthood of Wisconsin.\par \par \uc2 "There's only a certain degree you can prepare for," Linton said as staff readied for the coming week. "You just have to sort of adapt once we restart."\par \par \uc2 Members of Wisconsin Right to Life, an antiabortion group, were surprised by \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2 's decision and are examining next steps, including in the Legislature or through the courts, said Gracie Skogman, the group's legislative and PAC director. Skogman said the organization believes the legality of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Wisconsin is still unclear.\par \par \uc2 Over the past year, the group has expanded the hours and services offered at crisis pregnancy resource centers in the state, Skogman said. Those centers don't offer abortions and provide "life-affirming care," she said.\par \par \uc2 "Our hope would be that even in a situation where now \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is on the table again, there are so many women who have been able to get connected to the other resources that are available," Skogman said. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich427\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6405
