\par \par \uc2 A \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  facility in Chicago has been a destination for Wisconsin residents seeking abortions. PHOTO: Taylor Glascock for The Wall Street Journal\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2  locations have remained open for other services, including family planning, cancer diagnostic services and vasectomies. Wisconsin staff members have traveled once or twice a week to \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2 's clinic across the border in Waukegan, Ill., to help manage an influx of patients from their home state and around the country, according to Planned Parenthood of Illinois. Some patients who visited Planned Parenthood's Wisconsin locations to discuss their options ended up traveling for abortions at the Waukegan clinic, where they would be greeted by the same staff, Linton said.\par \par \uc2 Illinois, where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is protected under state law, has become a destination for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/illinois-abortion-clinics-are-preparing-for-a-potential-post-roe-world-11638419374"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 women seeking abortions nationwide }}}\uc2  since Dobbs. Planned Parenthood of Illinois has provided abortions to patients from 36 states. It said it has seen a sevenfold increase in Wisconsinites coming for abortions, making them the largest group of out-of-state patients. The return of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services in Wisconsin will allow clinics in Illinois to see more patients from other states, said Cristina Villarreal, chief of external affairs for Planned Parenthood of Illinois.\par \par \uc2 It will also cut in half the average distance a Wisconsinite might need to travel for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , according to research by Caitlin Myers, a \uc2 Middlebury College\uc2  economics professor who studies the effects of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies. About 800,000 women of reproductive age in Wisconsin will have to travel an average of 50 miles for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the Milwaukee and Madison clinics reopen\u8212\'20\'14compared with 100 miles before.\par \par \uc2 "It's going to substantially reduce the burden for Wisconsin residents seeking an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Myers said.\par \par \uc2 It couldn't be determined if or when Planned Parenthood of Wisconsin might resume appointments at its clinic in Sheboygan, where the district attorney has said he would enforce the 1849 law.\par \par \uc2 Linton said the organization is working toward resuming appointments there, but doesn't have a clear timeline as it sorts staffing and logistical issues.\par \par \uc2 "For better or for worse, I think we now have practice sort of adapting to whatever changes may come," Linton said.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights supporters and opponents both expect the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/new-justice-swings-wisconsin-supreme-court-to-the-left-76c30a95"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 state's Supreme Court }}}\uc2  to have the final say on the 1849 law. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/wisconsin-voters-to-decide-on-state-supreme-court-swing-seat-tuesday-d2445959"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Liberals gained control }}}\uc2  of the court for the first time in decades this year.\par \par \uc2 Resuming services at two clinics in liberal counties is an incremental approach to restoring access in the state until there is a clearer decision from the state Supreme Court, said Rachel Rebouch\u233\'00\'E9, the dean of Temple University Beasley School of Law, who studies \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive-health\b0 \highlight\uc2  law.\par \par \uc2 "That's a pretty firm foundation," Rebouch\u233\'00\'E9 said of \uc2 Planned Parenthood\uc2 's legal standing. "But it's not bulletproof and it won't be until the [state] Supreme Court decides how this applies or in what situations, or until the Legislature acts."\par \par \uc2 Write to Jennifer Calfas at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:jennifer.calfas@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jennifer.calfas@wsj.com }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230917ej9h000rt\par }{\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
