\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Biden Administration Asks Supreme Court to Maintain  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2 -Pill Access;  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  opponents challenged \uc2 FDA\uc2  approval and expansion of mifepristone\b0\par\par\uc2 By Laura Kusisto and Jess Bravin \par \uc2 687 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 September 2023\par 22:56 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON\u8212\'20\'14The Biden administration asked the Supreme Court to overrule a lower court decision limiting access to the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill mifepristone, pulling the justices back into the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  wars barely a year after a 5-4 decision overruled Roe v. Wade.\par \par \uc2 Last month, the Fifth U.S. Circuit Court of Appeals, in New Orleans, threw out \uc2 Food and Drug Administration\uc2  regulations that since 2016 eased the complicated dispensing protocols that followed mifepristone's original approval in 2000. The decision, if allowed to take effect, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/texas-abortion-pill-ruling-ignites-new-national-battle-a9c03329?"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 would limit nationwide access }}}\uc2  to the most common method for terminating a pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 In a Friday filing, U.S. Solicitor General \uc2 Elizabeth Prelogar\uc2  said the Fifth Circuit's decision, in a case brought by antiabortion doctors and medical organizations, was to the government's knowledge "the first time any court has restricted access to an \uc2 FDA\uc2 -approved drug based on disagreement with \uc2 FDA\uc2 's expert judgment about the conditions required to assure that drug's safe use\u8212\'20\'14much less done so after those conditions had been in effect for years."\par \par \uc2 Prelogar, the government's top appellate lawyer, said the case should never have been heard by the lower courts because the plaintiffs who filed suit have no stake in the outcome. "They do not prescribe mifepristone, and \uc2 FDA\uc2 's approval of the drug does not require them to do or refrain from doing anything," she wrote.\par \par \uc2 Last November, the antiabortion groups filed a federal lawsuit in Texas that argued the \uc2 FDA\uc2 's 2000 approval of mifepristone was flawed because the agency failed to adequately assess the drug's safety and inappropriately used an evaluation process meant for serious illness.\par \par \uc2 A U.S. district judge in Amarillo, Texas {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pill-approval-suspended-by-u-s-judge-3c5c88cf?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 issued an April ruling }}}\uc2  that largely agreed with those arguments and said the pill should be pulled from the market altogether.\par \par \uc2 The Fifth Circuit narrowed that decision somewhat, saying the challengers had likely waited too long to sue over the drug's original approval. But the appeals panel {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/health/pharma/appeals-panel-rules-fda-improperly-expanded-access-to-abortion-pill-4ffbd3b8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said the FDA had improperly expanded access to the pill }}}\uc2  in recent years, including allowing it to be administered without an in-person visit with a medical provider and expanding its authorization through 10 weeks of pregnancy from seven. If that decision stands, it would return the pill to tougher restrictions, some of which haven't been in place since 2016.\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court already had an early brush with the case, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-faces-fresh-deadline-in-abortion-pill-case-6d7b9049"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 granting an emergency request by the Biden administration }}}\uc2  to keep current mifepristone access in place while the litigation continued. That brief order, issued over the objection of Justices \uc2 Clarence Thomas\uc2  and \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2 , didn't address the merits of the dispute, but ensures that the drug will remain available until the Supreme Court disposes of the case.\par \par \uc2 If the justices accept the case, it would be argued in the term that begins next month, with a decision expected before July.\par \par \uc2 Danco Laboratories, the brand-name manufacturer of the drug, also filed a petition Friday asking the high court to intervene. "For the pharmaceutical and biotechnology industry, permitting judicial second-guessing of \uc2 FDA\uc2 's scientific evaluations of data will have a wildly destabilizing effect," the company said in its filing.\par \par \uc2 Mifepristone {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-pill-access-case-texas-judge-11651775689"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blocks a hormone needed to sustain pregnancy }}}\uc2  and is typically part of a two-drug regime. The other drug, misoprostol, can be taken alone but is less effective and can come with more severe side effects.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access remains in legal crosshairs in many places around the country more than a year after the Supreme Court ended federal constitutional protections for the procedure. State constitutional challenges to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans are pending in states including Florida and Utah. In South Carolina, the state's highest court earlier this year found that a six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban violated the state's constitution before {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/policy/south-carolina-supreme-court-upholds-six-week-abortion-ban-8258da02"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reversing itself }}}\uc2  and allowing a similar law to go into effect.\par \par \uc2 Write to Laura Kusisto at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Laura.Kusisto@wsj.com }}}\uc2  and Jess Bravin at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Jess.Bravin@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jess.Bravin@wsj.com }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020230908ej98008c1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
